{"success":true,"data":[{"id":"4221","title":"Weights for the Classic Talk Plate to be run on Friday, 24th July 2026.","created":"2026-07-18 09:52:08","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>ROYAL WESTERN INDIA TURF CLUB LTD.<br />\r\n\t\t\t\tPUNE MEETING 2026, SPECIAL RACE DAY, FRIDAY, 24TH JULY, 2026.</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>The Classic Talk Plate&nbsp; (Terms,Indian Horses, 3 years old only).</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>(About) 1000 Metres.</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><strong>Weights as per the terms of the race.</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><strong>( 43) ELEVATE&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 53&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ( 27) BLUE EYED GIRL&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 48.5&nbsp;&nbsp; ( - ) SAFFRON GLOW&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 48.5</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><strong>( - ) ROCK ARMOUR&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 50&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ( 38) BLUE JET&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 52.5&nbsp;&nbsp; ( 26) TRANQUILA&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 48.5</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><strong>( 40) STORM MAJESTY&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 53&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ( 36) LATIOS&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 51.5</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><strong>( - ) AMELIA EARHART&nbsp;&nbsp; 48.5&nbsp;&nbsp; ( 39) PINNACLE&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 51.5</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\tPune : 18th July 2026</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","published":"Y","new":"Y"},{"id":"4218","title":"Notice - 111th AGM of the Members of the Royal Western India Turf Club, Limited will be held on Thursday, 17th September 2026 through Video Conferencing. ","created":"2026-07-14 12:03:11","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"/page_images/Notice 111 AGM.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px; height: 5715px;\" /></div>\r\n\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","published":"Y","new":"Y"},{"id":"4217","title":"Notice - Re:Dress Regulations In The Paddock And Weighing Room At The Pune Race Course For Pune Meeting 2026.","created":"2026-07-10 12:04:08","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"/page_images/rwitclogo.jpg\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 100px;\" /></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>ROYAL WESTERN INDIA TURF CLUB, LTD.</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span new=\"\" style=\"font-family: \" times=\"\">Race Course, Mahalakshmi, Mumbai &ndash; 400 034.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong><u>NOTICE</u></strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>RE:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>DRESS REGULATIONS IN THE PADDOCK AND WEIGHING ROOM AT THE PUNE RACE COURSE FOR PUNE MEETING 2026.</u></strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">The Committee of the Club has decided that the following will be suitable attire for gentlemen desiring entry in the paddock and Weighing Room at the Pune Race Course during the Pune Meeting 2026.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<ol>\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>JACKET</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>SAFARI SUIT</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>NATIONAL DRESS</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>SHIRT INCLUDING HALF SLEEVE SHIRT WITH TIE OR SCARF</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t</ol>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">It has been further decided not to have any particular dress regulations in other areas of the Members&rsquo; Enclosure at the Pune Race Course, for Pune Meeting 2026. Banians, chappals, etc. will not be permitted in the Members&rsquo; Enclosure.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">In order to adhere to the dress regulations strictly, the Club would be employing security personnel near the paddock and Weighing Room. Those who are not properly attired in consonance with the dress regulations and who unwillingly follow the same, will not be permitted to enter and if such persons are found inside, they will be asked to leave the paddock and Weighing Room.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">It has been noticed that several Members do not display their badges, thus making it very difficult for the staff on duty to identify and check unauthorized persons in the Members&rsquo; Enclosure. Members are requested to prominently display their Badges and / or show their Identity Cards on request by the Staff on Duty. Co-operation of Members is solicited to prevent the entry of unauthorized persons in the Members&rsquo; Enclosure.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">It may please be noted that the Committee of the Club has decided that even if a person purchases a Mobile Phone Badge, the use of mobile phones will not be permitted in the Paddock. Owners, Trainers and persons who are permitted to enter the paddock are requested to strictly adhere to this rule and switch off their mobile phones while entering the Paddock.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Members are requested to ensure that the abovementioned regulations are strictly adhered to and their guests are informed accordingly.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">BY ORDER OF THE COMMITTEE</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Niranjan Singh</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Secretary,</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">ROYAL WESTERN INDIA TURF CLUB, LTD.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Mumbai: 9<sup>th</sup> July 2026.</span></span></div>\r\n\t</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","published":"Y","new":"Y"},{"id":"4216","title":"Chart & Sheet Prospectus for Pune Meeting 2026","created":"2026-07-04 12:17:01","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><em style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong background-color:=\"\" font-size:=\"\" new=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\" times=\"\">Click below link</strong></em></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><a href=\"https://rwitc.com/news/CHART%20-%20PUNE%20Meeting%202026.pdf\">CHART-PUNE MEETING 2026</a></span></span></strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><a href=\"https://rwitc.com/news/PROSPECTUS%20-%20PUNE%20Meeting%202026.pdf\">SHEET PROSPECTUS-PUNE MEETING 2026</a></span></span></strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pune: 4th July 2026.</span></span></div>\r\n\t</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","published":"Y","new":"N"},{"id":"4214","title":"Sheet Prospectus for Sweepstakes Races to be run during the Pune Meeting 2026","created":"2026-07-02 04:22:28","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong font-size:=\"\" new=\"\" style=\"font-family: \" times=\"\">Click below link</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong><a href=\"https://rwitc.com/news/Sweepstakes%20Sheet%20Prospectus%20Pune%20Meeting%202026.pdf\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">h</span></a></strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#00f;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong><a href=\"https://rwitc.com/news/Sweepstakes%20Sheet%20Prospectus%20Pune%20Meeting%202026.pdf\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">SHEET PROSPECTUS FOR SWEEPSTAKES RACES TO BE RUN DURING THE PUNE MEETING 2026</span></a></strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong><a href=\"https://rwitc.com/news/Sweepstakes%20Sheet%20Prospectus%20Pune%20Meeting%202026.pdf\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">f</span></a></strong></span></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Pune: 2nd July 2026</span></span></div>\r\n\t</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","published":"Y","new":"N"},{"id":"4213","title":"Veteran racehorse Trainer Syed S. Shah passes away - By Vinayak Zodge | The Hindu","created":"2026-06-28 14:39:21","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><strong>Veteran racehorse Trainer Syed S. Shah passes away</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t- By Vinayak Zodge | The Hindu</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Veteran racehorse trainer Syed S. Shah, 88, passed away on Sunday (June 28) morning at a city hospital here.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">He suffered a stroke about 15 days ago and remained in critical condition for the last three days.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Shah secured his trainer&rsquo;s license in 1969 and went on to dedicate more than five decades to the sport, becoming one of the most respected names in horse racing.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">He retired from his illustrious 55-year-long career at the Royal Western India Turf Club (RWITC) on March 23, 2025.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">He learned the basics of training from his elder brother, the late S.M. Shah. Following his guidance, Shah trained horses for several renowned owners, building a strong reputation.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">His first major success came in 1973 when his horse Mansoor caused a big upset by winning the Indian Derby.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">In a memorable moment, Mansoor defeated the favourite Bade Miya, trained by his own brother S.M. Shah.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Over the years, Shah trained more than 900 winners. One of his finest achievements came in 2008 when he won the Indian Derby with Hotstepper, 35 years after his first Derby success.</span></span></div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">He followed it up with another Derby victory in 2009 with Antonios, completing a remarkable back-to-back double and firmly establishing his legacy in Indian racing.</span></span></div>\r\n\t</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","published":"Y","new":"N"},{"id":"4212","title":"Ratings of 3 years old horses as of 30 March 2026","created":"2026-04-27 11:58:07","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"/page_images/3 yr old rating - 27-04-2026.jpeg\" style=\"width: 971px; height: 1600px;\" /></p>\r\n\t</body>\r\n</html>\r\n","published":"Y","new":"N"},{"id":"4211","title":"Champions of the Mumbai Meeting 2025-26","created":"2026-04-08 09:42:43","body":"<html>\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<title></title>\r\n\t</head>\r\n\t<body>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:460px;\" width=\"460\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td colspan=\"3\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" style=\"width:460px;height:28px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>CHAMPIONS OF THE MUMBAI MEETING 2025/26</strong></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" style=\"width:65px;height:21px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Sr. No.</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" style=\"width:224px;height:21px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>&nbsp;Owner</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" style=\"width:171px;height:21px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Total </strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td nowrap=\"nowrap\" style=\"width:65px;height:20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\r\n